  = help: the trait `IntoLabel` is not implemented for `std::option::Option<&str>`
  = note: `IntoLabel` is implemented by `&'static str`, `String`, `Str`, `StyledStr`, `Text`, `Label`, and `Binding<T>` / `Computed<T>` whose `T` is `IntoText`. For a label rendered as an arbitrary view, use `Label::new(semantic_text, || view)`.
  = help: the following other types implement trait `IntoLabel`:
            &'static str
            Computed<T>
            Label
            StyledStr
            std::string::String
            waterui::Binding<T>
            waterui::Str
            waterui::component::Text
